Title: "Author Headers"
Id: "aed49374-2774-44ae-b74a-70d23da00b98"

Text: "Author headers begin with `@` and are used by `Person:` groups.

```mlg-fragment
[@ada.lovelace]
Person: \"Ada Lovelace\"
```

The header is a stable identifier. The displayed name comes from the `Person:` section."
Id: "0674568c-2398-4e27-837c-7edba04a580a"
